# Minsitthar, Courageous Warrior

> Minsitthar is not a fighter who wins by out-trading you in a straight line. He is a jailer with a spear: he stacks Mark of the King until one enemy has to leave, then drops King's Calling to make leaving impossible. Pick him when the enemy carries live on movement skills, and build him for attack speed, not the old Thunder Belt tank.

