Reviewed against patch 2.1.95 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Inspire Phalanx DPS (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Thunder Belt, Immortality
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, War Cry
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Sea Halberd over Golden Staff when Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP frontliners matter more than maximum passive-stack speed.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst that hits before a late revive can convert into a second engage.; Malefic Roar over Immortality when Use when armor-stacking frontliners survive the full King's Calling window.; Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into low-CC physical EXP lanes where early armor is more valuable than Fortitude.
- Total cost: 10870 gold

Default EXP damage setup. Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, and Golden Staff make Shield Assault and Inspire rapidly trigger Mark of the King while Thunder Belt and Immortality keep Minsitthar alive after the ult commits.

### EXP Thunder Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Corrosion Scythe, Dominance Ice, Athena's Shield, Immortality
