- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against repeated magic hits that stack through poke before the real engage starts.; Antique Cuirass over Athena's Shield when Use when physical skill burst is the reason Minsitthar dies before Phalanx state gets value.; Demon Hunter Sword over Dominance Ice when Use when your team already has reliable anti-heal and Minsitthar must threaten tanks inside the field.; Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use against physical lanes with light crowd control and no early magic burst.
- Total cost: 10850 gold

Durability-first EXP setup for games where Minsitthar must check space, start with Flicker angles, and keep anti-dash control available through long objective fights.

### Conceal Anti-Dash Roam (Roam)

